WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.192 --> 00:00:02.890
Harry: From calorie
count to portion sizes,

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:04.240
we wanted to find out all the differences

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:06.780
between Halal Guys in the UK and the US.

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:08.447
This is "Food Wars."

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:16.244
In the UK, you can get your
order in three portion sizes.

00:00:16.244 --> 00:00:17.913
As a small platter,

00:00:17.913 --> 00:00:19.672
as a regular platter,

00:00:19.672 --> 00:00:21.222
or as a sandwich.

00:00:21.222 --> 00:00:22.948
The Halal Guys in the
US, your order can come

00:00:22.948 --> 00:00:26.989
in three sizes: small, regular, sandwich.

00:00:26.989 --> 00:00:28.665
We're going to weigh a regular
platter in both countries

00:00:28.665 --> 00:00:30.078
to see whose is the biggest.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.106
[beep]

00:00:33.106 --> 00:00:35.290
It's been so many episodes.

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:38.120
Why don't we just get bigger scales?

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:40.106
Bear with us one second.

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:42.650
[elevator music plays]

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:46.123
First half is about 337 grams.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:52.390
337 plus 321,

00:00:52.390 --> 00:00:53.348
six

00:00:53.348 --> 00:00:55.139
five

00:00:55.139 --> 00:00:56.022
eight?

00:00:56.022 --> 00:00:57.690
Quick maths.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:00.680
This thing, we need to wash this thing.

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:01.928
It's getting funky in here.

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:05.033
Here we go, the regular.

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:08.130
Whoa, fits in perfectly.

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:09.513
640.

00:01:09.513 --> 00:01:11.504
640 grams. That's a full meal.

00:01:12.771 --> 00:01:15.090
Oh, man, this smells so good.

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:17.420
Fries in the UK only
come in one portion size,

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:18.253
this one.

00:01:18.253 --> 00:01:21.994
In the US, The Halal Guys
also only have one size fries.

00:01:21.994 --> 00:01:24.500
Look at this case. Have you seen this?

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.400
Do you think it's to keep them crispy,

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:26.580
so they don't get soggy?

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:28.743
Very smart. Very innovative.

00:01:28.743 --> 00:01:29.770
I want to eat this so badly.

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:30.740
We gotta weigh it first.

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:32.498
This could be another brick.

00:01:33.955 --> 00:01:35.252
[fries plop onto scale]

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:37.748
Ayy.

00:01:37.748 --> 00:01:39.781
So, a side of fries from a UK Halal Guys

00:01:39.781 --> 00:01:41.647
came to 213 grams.

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:46.176
Wait. Oh, yeah, OK. Yeah.

00:01:46.176 --> 00:01:50.009
145 grams for one size

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:52.434
of Halal Guys fries.

00:01:54.723 --> 00:01:57.740
Oh, yeah. Yo. I've never gotten the fries.

00:01:57.740 --> 00:01:59.660
These are good! Crispy.

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:01.960
Don't sleep on the Halal Guys fries.

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:04.285
In the UK, a side of hummus
only comes in one size,

00:02:04.285 --> 00:02:05.493
and it's this one right here.

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:10.130
In the US of A,

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:13.047
Halal Guys hummus only comes in one size,

00:02:13.047 --> 00:02:15.460
and, of course, we are going to weigh it.

00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:16.809
Harry: So, our side
order of hummus came in

00:02:16.809 --> 00:02:18.643
at 246 grams.

00:02:18.643 --> 00:02:20.315
I'm going to eat all of this

00:02:20.315 --> 00:02:21.860
as soon as the cameras stop rolling.

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:23.560
A side order of baba ghanoush in the UK

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:25.090
only comes in one size as well.

00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:27.498
Joe: In the US, the baba
ghanoush at The Halal Guys

00:02:27.498 --> 00:02:30.340
is also just one size.

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:31.880
In the UK, you can get a side of falafel,

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:33.670
and it comes as a two-piece serving.

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:35.680
We did ask for some, but
I think the guy forgot,

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:37.115
so we don't have any to show you.

00:02:37.115 --> 00:02:38.750
In the US at The Halal Guys, you can get

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:41.268
your falafel in three sizes:

00:02:41.268 --> 00:02:44.330
two pieces, four pieces, or six pieces.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:45.809
We can also get falafel sandwiches.

00:02:46.909 --> 00:02:48.340
Let's take some measurements.

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:50.930
Our falafel sandwich is
8 inches in diameter.

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:52.310
And for the moment you've
all been waiting for,

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:53.734
we're going to measure the girth.

00:02:53.734 --> 00:02:57.100
The tape measurer is
really not fit to task.

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:59.010
Actually, that's going to work.

00:02:59.010 --> 00:03:00.510
And our falafel sandwich has a girth of,

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:02.210
let's say, 7-and-a-bit inches.

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:06.581
From pita to pita,

00:03:06.581 --> 00:03:08.510
8 inches? Yeah?

00:03:08.510 --> 00:03:09.826
Oh, look at that!

00:03:09.826 --> 00:03:12.893
And it's 8 inches thick.

00:03:12.893 --> 00:03:13.948
8 and 8.

00:03:13.948 --> 00:03:16.190
I like when things are
just precise like that.

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:19.890
Harry: And, finally, it weighs 286 grams.

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:23.063
And a falafel sandwich
at the US Halal Guys

00:03:23.063 --> 00:03:24.087
♪ weighs ♪

00:03:25.354 --> 00:03:26.519
like, exactly --

00:03:26.519 --> 00:03:28.194
[burps] Excuse me.

00:03:28.194 --> 00:03:30.910
Exactly 250 grams.

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:32.030
In the UK, if you want dessert

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:33.720
at Halal Guys, you can get baklava.

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:35.439
It comes in a two-piece serving.

00:03:35.439 --> 00:03:37.422
Halal Guys in the US, the baklava

00:03:37.422 --> 00:03:39.970
comes in one size, in this one piece.

00:03:39.970 --> 00:03:41.103
This piece right here.

00:03:42.810 --> 00:03:44.010
Oops, I ordered two!

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:45.570
I guess I'll just have to eat one.

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:47.053
Who am I kidding? I'm
eating both of these.

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:51.102
Unfortunately, Halal Guys doesn't make

00:03:51.102 --> 00:03:52.545
its nutritional information available

00:03:52.545 --> 00:03:53.750
for its UK products.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.500
We did find some in the store,

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:57.130
and, luckily, I took a picture.

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:58.840
From this, we now know that the sandwiches

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:02.630
range anywhere from 419
calories to 694 calories,

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:05.730
and the platters range
anywhere from 471 calories

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:07.615
to 1,049 calories.

00:04:07.615 --> 00:04:08.929
It's fairly safe to assume that

00:04:08.929 --> 00:04:11.178
the 1,049-calorie platter is probably

00:04:11.178 --> 00:04:13.470
one of the meat ones
with all of the sides,

00:04:13.470 --> 00:04:15.456
all of the sauces, pretty
much everything you can get.

00:04:15.456 --> 00:04:17.790
1,049 calories will take you to just over

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:19.700
half of your normal daily allowance.

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:20.875
The combo platter is said to be

00:04:20.875 --> 00:04:23.160
Halal Guys' most popular menu item.

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:24.670
This is a regular combo platter

00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:27.600
before any white or red
sauce has been added.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:30.078
I would recommend not
eating it until it is added.

00:04:30.078 --> 00:04:30.936
That's just me.

00:04:30.936 --> 00:04:34.820
Our regular combo platter is 794 calories,

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:37.493
23 grams of fat, 10
grams of saturated fat,

00:04:37.493 --> 00:04:41.182
1,998 milligrams of sodium,

00:04:41.182 --> 00:04:44.060
which I believe is 86%
of your daily intake,

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:46.245
and also 96 grams of carbs.

00:04:46.245 --> 00:04:48.355
Of course we're adding
white and red sauces, right?

00:04:48.355 --> 00:04:49.188
OK.

00:04:49.188 --> 00:04:50.393
The white sauce pouch.

00:04:50.393 --> 00:04:52.990
One of these is roughly 330 calories,

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:56.120
37 grams of fat, 6 grams of saturated fat,

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:58.570
420 milligrams of sodium.

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:00.053
420.
[bell dings]

00:05:00.053 --> 00:05:02.210
And 2 grams of carbs.

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:03.480
See this guy right here?

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:06.420
Each package of their hot
sauce adds only 7 calories,

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:09.320
but 89 milligrams of sodium.

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:10.540
Let's talk about the red sauce.

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:12.020
Now, according to the Halal Guys website,

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:13.480
their red sauce ranges from between

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:17.250
100,000 to 130,000 on the Scoville scale.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:18.380
To put that in perspective,

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:20.437
sriracha is somewhere around 2,500

00:05:20.437 --> 00:05:21.450
on the same scale,

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:23.800
and the infamous "Hot Ones" Da Bomb sauce

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:26.024
is around 135,000.

00:05:26.024 --> 00:05:27.810
So pretty close to this.

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:29.340
Halal Guys has something called

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:30.520
the Hot Sauce Challenge.

00:05:30.520 --> 00:05:32.428
What it is, is a small platter

00:05:32.428 --> 00:05:35.354
with 20 lines of their hot sauce,

00:05:35.354 --> 00:05:36.604
and you've got to be able to eat

00:05:36.604 --> 00:05:39.392
the whole thing in 10 minutes

00:05:39.392 --> 00:05:42.007
with no assistance of any beverages,

00:05:42.007 --> 00:05:43.350
not only during while you're eating it,

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:44.901
but also five minutes after.

00:05:44.901 --> 00:05:46.501
Sorry, what are we doing?

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:51.373
So, one, two --

00:05:51.373 --> 00:05:52.947
It's times like this where you're like,

00:05:52.947 --> 00:05:56.090
"I should have a will
written, just in case."

00:05:56.090 --> 00:05:58.900
That's four. Oh, my God.

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:00.930
If I don't make it out of this,

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:02.966
someone tell my cat that I love him.

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:05.817
20. I'll just put this
whole thing in there.

00:06:05.817 --> 00:06:07.020
[laughs]

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:08.381
This is such a bad idea.

00:06:09.572 --> 00:06:10.561
Yeah.

00:06:12.968 --> 00:06:14.058
All right.

00:06:14.058 --> 00:06:17.225
[ominous music plays]

00:06:21.119 --> 00:06:23.017
Whoa. Yo!

00:06:25.615 --> 00:06:26.690
[coughs]

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:30.923
Oh, my God. This stuff is really hot.

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:35.047
Oh, man. I'm getting a
metallic taste in my mouth,

00:06:35.047 --> 00:06:36.693
like my mouth might be bleeding.

00:06:39.787 --> 00:06:41.562
[laughs]

00:06:48.746 --> 00:06:49.921
[coughs]

00:06:51.247 --> 00:06:54.160
OK. Yep, that's immediately spicy.

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:55.980
No slow burn here.

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:57.447
Oh, God.

00:06:58.554 --> 00:07:00.520
This was a mistake.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:01.495
[coughs]

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:04.180
It's, like, really good, dude.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.560
Oh, God. More.

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:14.250
How long's it been?

00:07:15.574 --> 00:07:17.048
[cry-laughs]

00:07:17.048 --> 00:07:19.881
OK, OK. I think I can manage this.

00:07:25.477 --> 00:07:26.986
[laughs]

00:07:29.968 --> 00:07:31.490
My eyes are watering.

00:07:31.490 --> 00:07:32.840
The throat is hurting.

00:07:33.991 --> 00:07:35.142
[clears throat]

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:38.658
This is really hot.

00:07:38.658 --> 00:07:41.780
My tongue, back of the mouth, everything.

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:43.088
[pounding]

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:47.060
No way I'm lasting five minutes.

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:48.963
I'm breaking early. God.

00:07:50.066 --> 00:07:53.470
[steam hisses]

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:54.834
I'm throwing in the towel. I can't do it.

00:07:54.834 --> 00:07:56.719
Producer: Yeah?
Joe: Yeah. Holy s---.

00:07:56.719 --> 00:07:58.127
How long was that?

00:07:58.127 --> 00:08:00.410
Producer: Three minutes and 10 seconds.

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:02.450
See, Nando's? That is spice.

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:05.211
If you advertise something
as spicy, at least deliver.

00:08:05.211 --> 00:08:07.119
And that's what Halal Guys have done.

00:08:07.119 --> 00:08:09.437
[production crew laughing]

00:08:09.437 --> 00:08:11.220
Whew!

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:13.203
People who build up tolerance

00:08:13.203 --> 00:08:14.613
in their mouth for spice,

00:08:14.613 --> 00:08:16.560
they also have the
tolerance for it going out.

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:18.670
Because the worst thing about spicy food

00:08:18.670 --> 00:08:21.830
for me is -- the second
worst is eating it.

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:24.446
The first worst is --

00:08:24.446 --> 00:08:26.212
it'll be about in five hours.

00:08:26.212 --> 00:08:27.183
Speaking of which.

00:08:30.310 --> 00:08:31.367
It would have been smarter to do this

00:08:31.367 --> 00:08:32.693
at the end of the shoot.

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:36.080
Now, if you were to go
with the falafel sandwich

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:39.130
in the US, it would be 641 calories,

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:42.025
26 grams of fat, 4 grams of saturated fat,

00:08:42.025 --> 00:08:44.324
1,259 milligrams of sodium,

00:08:44.324 --> 00:08:46.617
and 82 grams of carbs.

00:08:46.617 --> 00:08:47.858
[pants]

00:08:50.430 --> 00:08:51.910
Currently, Halal Guys
don't provide that much

00:08:51.910 --> 00:08:53.380
information when it
comes to the ingredients

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:54.960
of their meats and rices.

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:56.490
What we do know, as you can imagine,

00:08:56.490 --> 00:08:59.000
is that Halal Guys' food
is, indeed, halal certified.

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:01.100
The Halal Guys chicken recipe is a secret.

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:04.500
So we assume, similar to other
Middle Eastern street meats,

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:07.070
it is marinated in herbs, lemon,

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:08.710
olive oil, salt, and pepper.

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.410
I got all of this info from

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:12.188
the Halal Guys "Legendary Eats" story

00:09:12.188 --> 00:09:13.146
we did about a year ago,

00:09:13.146 --> 00:09:15.900
so thank you to those producers
for doing my homework.

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:17.220
The beef is also a secret recipe,

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:18.935
but from what we know,
it's likely to be flavored

00:09:18.935 --> 00:09:22.340
with things like salt,
pepper, oregano, and paprika.

00:09:22.340 --> 00:09:24.838
But The Halal Guys can't be
tight-lipped on their sauces

00:09:24.838 --> 00:09:26.540
now that they're available for retail.

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:29.210
So the hot sauce in the
US, and assuming the UK,

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:32.290
ingredients are ground
red pepper, vinegar,

00:09:32.290 --> 00:09:34.648
salt, various spices,

00:09:34.648 --> 00:09:36.606
question mark, question
mark, question mark?

00:09:36.606 --> 00:09:38.331
And concentrated lemon juice.

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:42.640
White sauce: soybean oil, water, egg yolk,

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:45.170
distilled vinegar, less than 2% of

00:09:45.170 --> 00:09:47.971
salt, sugar, spices, natural flavors,

00:09:47.971 --> 00:09:51.236
xanthan gum, sodium benzoate,

00:09:51.236 --> 00:09:53.510
and calcium

00:09:53.510 --> 00:09:56.077
disodium EDTA,

00:09:56.077 --> 00:09:57.135
or "ed-ta,"

00:09:57.135 --> 00:09:59.184
to maintain freshness.

00:09:59.184 --> 00:10:01.350
Contains eggs.

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:02.850
According to the white sauce packets,

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:06.220
it contains soybean oil, water, egg,

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:09.090
spirit vinegar, salt, sugar, pepper,

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:10.991
preservative potassium sorbate,

00:10:10.991 --> 00:10:12.466
thickener xanthan gum,

00:10:12.466 --> 00:10:13.299
mustard,

00:10:13.299 --> 00:10:15.999
antioxidant calcium disodium EDTA,

00:10:15.999 --> 00:10:17.590
and natural flavoring.

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:18.790
For the Halal Guys pita bread,

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:21.430
I had to do some deep
investigative journalism.

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:24.010
Specifically, I called The
Halal Guys in downtown LA,

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:27.053
and they told me that the
pitas they use are these:

00:10:27.053 --> 00:10:29.900
Kontos Gyro Bread Pre-Oiled.

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.730
Is this the pita breads they use for

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:33.060
all Halal Guys?

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:34.592
I called and emailed Kontos,

00:10:34.592 --> 00:10:35.783
and they did not get back to me.

00:10:35.783 --> 00:10:37.210
Guys, what's the story?

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:39.275
So I'm gonna assume that they do.

00:10:39.275 --> 00:10:42.466
So this pita contains unbleached,

00:10:42.466 --> 00:10:45.149
unbrom, bromated, no.

00:10:45.149 --> 00:10:47.780
Unbleached, unbromated, enriched flour,

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:49.780
niacin (B-complex vitamin),

00:10:49.780 --> 00:10:51.360
thiamine (B1 vitamin),

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:54.502
reduced iron, riboflavin (B2 vitamin),

00:10:54.502 --> 00:10:57.026
folic acid, water, and soybean oil,

00:10:57.026 --> 00:11:00.100
and contains 2% or less of
the following ingredients:

00:11:00.100 --> 00:11:02.170
calcium propionate (a preservative),

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:05.010
corn syrup solids. OK.

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:09.410
Fumaric acid, guar gum,
salt, sesame flour,

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:12.360
sodium bicarbonate, sorbic
acid (a preservative),

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:15.870
soy flour, sugar, vegetable
mono- and diglycerides,

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:18.670
vegetable L-cysteine, wheat enzymes,

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:21.172
whole-wheat flour, and yeast.

00:11:21.172 --> 00:11:22.136
One thing to look out for there

00:11:22.136 --> 00:11:23.860
is the fumaric acid that they use.

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:25.300
While this is practically nontoxic

00:11:25.300 --> 00:11:27.350
because the amounts in
our food are very small,

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:29.460
the European Union does
say that in high doses,

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:30.610
this can be nephrotoxic,

00:11:30.610 --> 00:11:32.160
which is toxic to your kidneys.

00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:33.830
So you might want to go easy on the pitas.

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:35.725
One thing we found out just
by purchasing the product

00:11:35.725 --> 00:11:37.712
is that the baklava in
the UK actually contains

00:11:37.712 --> 00:11:39.420
some questionable food colorings.

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:42.509
The first is Blue 1, also
known as Brilliant Blue.

00:11:42.509 --> 00:11:44.040
This is kind of hard to come by in the UK,

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:45.280
as it's just fallen out of favor

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:47.290
thanks to the Smarties controversy.

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:48.613
Blue 1 used to be the blue coloring

00:11:48.613 --> 00:11:50.140
used in Smarties in the UK.

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:51.828
However, it was removed
after there was a panic

00:11:51.828 --> 00:11:54.369
about it potentially causing
hyperactivity in children.

00:11:54.369 --> 00:11:56.100
It famously took Smarties years to come up

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:58.000
with a natural replacement
for the blue coloring.

00:11:58.000 --> 00:11:59.510
They finally settled on spirulina,

00:11:59.510 --> 00:12:00.960
which is made from seaweed.

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:03.502
On a not unrelated note,
there's also Yellow 5 in here,

00:12:03.502 --> 00:12:05.040
also known as tartrazine.

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:06.550
Yellow 5 is one of the
chemicals highlighted

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:09.080
by a 2007 study
investigating links between

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:11.470
food colorings and
hyperactivity in children.

00:12:11.470 --> 00:12:13.140
The initial results
did seem to show a link

00:12:13.140 --> 00:12:14.702
between the two; however, since then,

00:12:14.702 --> 00:12:15.935
people have backtracked and said that

00:12:15.935 --> 00:12:17.540
further study may be required.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:19.300
Despite that, foods
containing these chemicals

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:21.120
in the European Union
must still bear a warning

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:22.485
that they may have an adverse effect

00:12:22.485 --> 00:12:23.960
on attention in children.

00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:26.027
We don't see a warning on
this box, so Halal Guys,

00:12:26.027 --> 00:12:28.201
you might want to update your packaging.

00:12:28.201 --> 00:12:30.234
[baklava crunches]

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:35.190
Here is everything you will only find

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:37.290
on the menu at a UK Halal Guys.

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:40.470
Here are the exclusives
you can get in the USA.

00:12:40.470 --> 00:12:41.740
Yeah, believe it or not, this is probably

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:43.130
our shortest exclusive section ever.

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:45.473
All the things you can only
find on the menu in the UK

00:12:45.473 --> 00:12:47.640
are an orange Fanta or a lemon Fanta.

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:49.600
I'm assuming you guys
do have Fanta in the US,

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:51.950
but for me, obviously,
Fanta orange is the classic.

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:54.233
However, Fanta lemon, absolutely amazing.

00:12:54.233 --> 00:12:56.120
For some reason it's not
super common in the UK,

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:58.061
but if you go into mainland Europe,

00:12:58.061 --> 00:13:00.944
particularly slightly hotter
places like Spain or Greece,

00:13:00.944 --> 00:13:02.330
this is kind of everywhere.

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:04.368
So for me, it just brings
back memories of, like,

00:13:04.368 --> 00:13:06.027
being on a beach bar with my family,

00:13:06.027 --> 00:13:08.330
sipping a Fanta lemon,
having a great time.

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:10.096
So, forgive me if I'm wrong.

00:13:10.096 --> 00:13:11.362
I didn't see this anywhere

00:13:11.362 --> 00:13:13.881
on the Halal Guys London menus.

00:13:13.881 --> 00:13:18.798
It is 16.9 fluid ounces
of the white sauce.

00:13:18.798 --> 00:13:20.000
Look how big this is.

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:21.893
This is hilarious.

00:13:21.893 --> 00:13:24.440
Ugh. Side of olives.

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:26.680
Oh, you can also get a side of jalapeños.

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:30.301
If the hot sauce wasn't
hot enough, here you go.

00:13:30.301 --> 00:13:32.524
You can also get yourself
a side of tahini.

00:13:32.524 --> 00:13:37.524
For desserts, you can also
get Halal Guys cookies.

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:38.843
That's pretty much it.

00:13:38.843 --> 00:13:40.290
I'm going to go and lie
down, because hot sauce

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:42.607
is a terrible invention. Cheers.

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:46.330
You know why this is trouble, though?

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:48.210
Because it still tastes really good.

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:52.843
I mean [laughs], I'm a
glutton for punishment.

